        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia D12198, Contemporary Round Door Knob Entry Door Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Contemporary Ball Knob Entry Lockset is modern not only because, for some reason, rectangular handlesets are known as such by default, but because of its sleek design. There is something very now about the pairing of the ball knob with this entry door lockset that is not only unique, but stylish. The Ball Door Knob Entry Door Lockset is available in dummy and single cylinder functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching <a href=\"/products/simple-ball-knob-omnia-198-60\">Ball Knobset</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Ball Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage \"C\"</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit narrow stiles. For Door with a 2-3⁄8” backset, stile width can be as narrow as 3-5⁄8”</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia D12198 Ball Knob Lockset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 10-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bore Hole Spacing (distance between deadbolt and knob latch): 5-1/2\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2\" Thick Doors (<a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> if doors are thicker)</li></li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Full 1\" Throw, Solid Brass with saw-proof Insert.</li>\r\n<li>Strike: \"T\" strike</li>\r\n<li>Each set contains door knobs, backplates, latches, spindle, and all necessary screws and templates. Key functions are supplied with lock cylinder/s and turnpiece as applicable. </li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/entry-lockset-specs.pdf?v=1704262242\" target=\"new\"><b>Omnia Entry Lockset Dimensions & Specs (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a knob operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Contemporary Ball Knob Entry Lockset",
                "description": "The Contemporary Ball Knob Entry Lockset is modern not only because, for some reason, rectangular handlesets are known as such by default, but because of its sleek design. There is something very now about the pairing of the ball knob with this entry door lockset that is not only unique, but stylish. The Ball Door Knob Entry Door Lockset is available in dummy and single cylinder functions.\r\n",
